OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1786969104
OL,3,CMet Police increased use of stop and
OL,4,Csearch by a fifth over last year
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police carried out
OL,7,Falmost 20% more stop and searches over
OL,8,Fthe last year and achieved the highest
OL,9,Ffind rate in the force's history in
OL,10,FJuly.
OL,12,FMore than a third of searches carried
OL,13,Fout in July resulted in officers
OL,14,Ffinding weapons, drugs, or other
OL,15,Fevidence of offending, new figures
OL,16,Freleased on Monday show.
OL,18,FIn 2025, stop and search helped
OL,19,Fofficers seize at least 3,800 weapons
OL,20,Fand discover illegal drugs on more
OL,21,Fthan 27,800 occasions.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/8
