FL,372,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1786969104
OL,3,CMet Police increased use of stop and
OL,4,Csearch by a fifth over last year
OL,6,FHistorically, higher rates of stop and
OL,7,Fsearch have been linked to lower
OL,8,Fdetection rates, but the 20% increase
OL,9,Fin use of the tactic over the last
OL,10,Fyear culminated in 36% of searches in
OL,11,FJuly 2026 uncovering evidence of
OL,12,Fcriminal activity.
OL,14,FA statement from the Met claimed this
OL,15,Fwas as a result of "officers making
OL,16,Fmore precise and considered stops".
OL,26,@wD@TOUxD@bO]
