FL,372,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1786969104
OL,3,CMet Police increased use of stop and
OL,4,Csearch by a fifth over last year
OL,6,FThat led to a national public
OL,7,Fconsultation on updated police stop-
OL,8,Fand-search standards being launched by
OL,9,Fthe College of Policing.
OL,11,FThe consultation, which finished in
OL,12,FJuly, invited views from police
OL,13,Fofficers and staff, partner agencies,
OL,14,Fcommunity organisations and members of
OL,15,Fthe public.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/8
