OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,372,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1786969104
OL,3,CMet Police increased use of stop and
OL,4,Csearch by a fifth over last year
OL,6,FAssistant commissioner Ade Adelekan,
OL,7,Fthe Met's stop and search lead, said:
OL,8,F"Stop and search remains a vital tool
OL,9,Fin helping officers remove weapons
OL,10,Ffrom our streets, apprehend dangerous
OL,11,Foffenders and ultimately save lives.
OL,13,F"But it is also a tactic that must be
OL,14,Fused fairly, professionally and with
OL,15,Fthe confidence of the communities we
OL,16,Fserve.
OL,26,@pD@AOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/8
