OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,372,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F371A1786969104
OL,3,CMet Police increased use of stop and
OL,4,Csearch by a fifth over last year
OL,6,F"We know that concerns around
OL,7,Fdisproportionality remain,
OL,8,Fparticularly among Black Londoners,
OL,9,Fand we are committed to understanding
OL,10,Fand addressing those concerns through
OL,11,Fgreater scrutiny, transparency and
OL,12,Faccountability.
OL,14,F"The results we are seeing show that
OL,15,Fby focusing on quality rather than
OL,16,Fsimply quantity, we can both improve
OL,17,Foutcomes and raise standards."
OL,26,@nD@AOUvD@AOUyD@^O]
